      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings: EPS and revenues exceed analyst expectations",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹131 (up from ₹58.20 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹33.8b (up 44% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹6.64b (up 130% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 20% (up from 12% in FY 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Revenue exceeded analyst estimates by 1.5%. Earnings per share (EPS) also surpassed analyst estimates by 5.5%. Revenue is forecast to grow 15% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 13% growth forecast for the Chemicals industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 17% per year whereas the company’s share price has increased by 13% per year.",
